  "body": "Welcome to a beautifully appointed residence offering comfort, style, and superb convenience - perfectly positioned in one of the North Shore’s most desirable suburbs.\r\n\r\nThis contemporary two-bedroom, two-bathroom home is designed for effortless living. The master suite comes complete with its own ensuite, while the additional bedroom and bathroom provide flexibility for family, guests, or your work-from-home needs. Enjoy open-plan living and dining spaces that flow seamlessly into a sleek, modern kitchen, creating the ideal backdrop for entertaining or relaxing at home.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• 2 generous bedrooms (including a master with ensuite)  \r\n• 2.5 modern bathrooms  \r\n• 1 allocated car park  \r\n• Open-plan living and dining  \r\n• Stylish, contemporary kitchen  \r\n• Low-maintenance design for easy living  \r\n• Zoned for Rangitoto College, Pinehill School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Northcross Intermediate  \r\n• An easy stroll to Browns Bay shops, restaurants, pristine beaches, and local amenities  \r\n\r\nWhether you’re a first-home buyer, savvy investor, or looking to downsize without compromise, this is a rare opportunity to secure a modern home in a prime location.\r\n\r\nExperience the best of Browns Bay living. Enquire today to arrange your private viewing.",
